+## Thresholds
+- `--threshold <metric>=<min>` (repeatable) gates CI on metric scores.
+- Exit code 0 if all thresholds pass (or no thresholds); exit 1 if any fail; exit 2 for usage errors.
+- A metric with no score fails its threshold; report is always written unless validation fails.
+- Valid metric IDs at CLI invocation time: exact_match, toxicity, length_variance.
+- SDK users can pass custom metrics to `runEvaluations` and thresholds to `generateReport`.
+
 ## Follow-up Tasks
 1. Integrate real toxicity/bias models once provider abstraction is implemented (Phase 0 → Providers milestone).
 2. Extend datasets loader to support configurable schema mapping.
